# f1 = read, f2 = store
# A class whose base returns its argument lays a field on objects of five other classes. They may gain properties, and no list names all that they may gain.
# Whoever adds a property to an object that never gains one is stopped; here nobody is. So that nothing of its own hides an accessor declared above is not taken from the tables:
# a guard of the class is asked, which ends where an object lays the name, and the body of the accessor stands behind it.
# RUN(READ): walk f1 mechanisms=all
# READ: [[read]]: boolean @Boolean = AreMembersUnchanged conditions=[{layout=L2 key="twice"}]
# READ-NEXT: Branch [[read]] ->
# READ: GetSlot {{*}} key="level"
# READ: PropGet {{*}} key="twice"
# RUN(STORE): walk f2 mechanisms=all
# STORE: [[store]]: boolean @Boolean = AreMembersUnchanged conditions=[{layout=L2 key="twice"}]
# STORE-NEXT: Branch [[store]] ->
# STORE: PutSlot {{*}} key="level"
# STORE: PropSet {{*}} key="twice"
# RUN: run-in-shell void 0;
# CHECK: 6
# CHECK-NEXT: 5 level,note
# CHECK-NEXT: exited with 0
# RUN(CHECKED): run-in-shell testing=CheckProofsAtRunTime,CheckWalkAtRunTime void 0;
